      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "DATE : 20.04.2023 PER COURT :\nThese are the applications seeking quashment of Crime No.82/2021 registered with Police Station Parali (Rural) for the offence punishable under Section 498A, 323, 504,506 read with Section 34 of the Indian Penal Code and the subsequent criminal case bearing R.C.C. No.226/2021 pending before the Judicial Magistrate, First Class, Parali Vaijnath, District Beed on the basis of the terms of settlement arrived at between the applicants on the one hand and the respondent No.2 on the other.\n2. We have heard both the sides and the learned APP and perused the Affidavit-in-reply filed by the respondent No.2 wherein she inter alia for the reasons mentioned therein and in pursuance to the terms of settlement gives no objection for quashment of the crime.\n1000.Appln.396.23.odt 3.",
